  "steps": [
    "Add the millet, dal, veggies, salt, haldi, 1 tsp oil to a cooker with 4-5 cups of water.",
    "Cook for 4-5 whistles and until then prep the tadka.",
    "Add ghee/oil to a pan along with jeera, mustard, minced garlic, green chilli, red chilli, curry leaves.",
    "Sauté for a min and add onion, bell peppers.",
    "Cook for 2 mins and add your cooked khichdi along with sambar powder, sugar, red chilli powder, and imli water.",
    "Add a little water to adjust consistency and let it come to a boil! Its ready.",
    "For the tofu chilli, just sauté 150g tofu with 1 tsp chilli oil, salt and lemon juice."
